	"response_required": true,
	"text": "SyberSerf, the ultimate provider of high-protein snacks. A bit more expensive than DELCO, but who can put a price on size of arm and an economically-charged world view?\n\nYou sign right on the dotted line.\n\nWith your work finished for the day, it's time to head home.\n\nJust as you're about to leave, Dirk appears, arms stretched wide across your desk,\n\n'Good work today, bud. How's about a drink with your new boss, celebrate the new day- you know, Guy?'"
